  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your tremors unleash a geyser of caustic fluid.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Shaitan Earthblast<sup>UC</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You add your mythic tier to the damage dealt by your Shaitan Earthblast, and the eruption of the ground that accompanies it turns the ground in the area into difficult terrain. Creatures failing their save against your Shaitan Earthblast are knocked prone.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-combat-n-z-feats#toc64\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
